EMF + Corpse
I've tried all cases and it all leads me to EMF having the issue. The mod that has problems with is the Corpse mod (The mod is similar to gravestone however it renders a player type character rather than just a gravestone block.) While having those 2 together with the resourcepack (Fresh Moves which includes eye movement and player animations), for some unknown reason my game keeps fully crashing. The issue persists in every World non-dependant of the gamemode player type. After crashing I am not able to rejoin the world anymore until I disable the EMF mod. For some reason the whole thing is happening because of the rendering process upon the dummy being created. 
The version I am currently using is 1.20.1 so I am not really sure if it's fixed on the newer ones.

Reproducing the issue:
1. Install the Official Corpse Mod latest version, EMF and Fresh Animations.
2. Create a new world
3. Use the /kill command and try to face the death dummy on the ground.

What's expected is to see how the game completely crashes and either saves or not the world properly. Then after retrying to join back into it, it would just continue crashing the game until you disable EMF.

